<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>Sign in to view the archive</title>
<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    background: #f6f5f2;
    color: #23201c;
    font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  main {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ddd8d0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  a.button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    background: #2f6f4f;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a.button.secondary { background: #6b665e; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Sign in to view the archive</h1>
  <p>
    Welcome to the footbag.org legacy archive, the preserved original footbag.org site.
    It is open to signed-in IFPA members: if you are a member, sign in at footbag.org and
    you will be straight through.
  </p>
  <p>
    Already signed in earlier? Sessions expire after a while. Signing in again takes a
    moment; then follow the Legacy Archive link to come back here.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="button" href="${login_url}">Sign in at footbag.org</a>
    <a class="button secondary" href="${site_url}">Go to footbag.org</a>
  </p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
